OL,3,GNEWSADoctor at centre of sexual
OL,4,Aharassment case 'lost faith in NHS'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA doctor sexually harassed by a
OL,7,Fcolleague who has since been struck off
OL,8,Fthe medical register says she has lost
OL,9,Fall faith in the NHS.
OL,11,FA tribunal heard Dr Jawad Ahmad trapped
OL,12,Fthe victim in an office at Royal Stoke
OL,13,FUniversity Hospital, in Stoke-on-Trent,
OL,14,Fpushed her on to a chair, and then
OL,15,Fmassaged and kissed her.
OL,17,F"I lost trust in my employer and the
OL,18,FNHS to listen to me, believe me and
OL,19,Fprotect me," she said, adding that she
OL,20,Fwas still suffering from trauma.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
