OL,3,GNEWSADoctor at centre of sexual
OL,4,Aharassment case 'lost faith in NHS'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUniversity Hospitals of North Midlands
OL,7,F(UHNM) said it had reviewed processes
OL,8,Fand remained "fully committed to
OL,9,Fproviding a safe environment" for all
OL,10,Fstaff.
